{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_page_title":true,"heading_align":"text-center"}},"use_image_banner_9MTjTb":{"type":"use-image-banner","blocks":{"heading_PR7PMQ":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Share the Moment","display_one_line_for_text":false,"header_description":"","show_header_color":false,"set_header_color":"","show_text_glow":false,"show_text_gradient":false,"title_one_color":"","title_one_color_size":"","title_two_color":"","title_two_color_size":"","title_three_color":"","title_three_color_size":"","title_four_color":"","title_four_color_size":"","title_color_angle":"45","heading_size":"h2","add_class_name":false,"use_class_name":"","header_weight":false,"header_uppercase":false,"heading_h1":true,"mobile_one_color":"#2a2a2a"}},"text_g4AnR7":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Get your best moments with Monument Grills, sumbit for rewards.<\/p>","text_size":"h4","is_text_segmentation":false,"font_weight":false,"font_uppercase":false,"text_segmentation":"","text_segmentation_color":"","text_segmentation_size":"h4"}}},"block_order":["heading_PR7PMQ","text_g4AnR7"],"settings":{"link_id":"","full_screen":true,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"show_tab":false,"tabbar_title_one":"","tabbar_title_two":"","tabbar_title_three":"","tabbar_title_color":"","tabbar_title_hover_color":"","tabbar_title_active_color":"","image_desktop":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UGC-1-0327.jpg","url":"","height_mode":"fixed","fixed_height_desktop":400,"fixed_height_mobile":350,"overlay_position":"justify-center items-center","info_max_width":70,"position_right":40,"overlay_text_align":"text-center","mob_center_text":false,"mobile_stacked":false,"text_bg":false,"mobile_position":false,"mobile_overlay_position":"mobile-top-center","color_scheme":"white","full_width":true,"transparent_content_color":"#ffffff","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":25,"prevent_animation":false,"use_background_box":false,"background_box_bg":"","background_box_text_color":"","top_offset_position":10,"background_box_position":"top_center","show_gradient_font_offset_position":false,"gradient_font_offset_position":10}},"pop_up_slider_gRBxyV":{"type":"pop-up-slider","blocks":{"popup_YXwegW":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/9_f10c1d2a-ba1d-4600-81ea-83e5ad60898b.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"From Backyard to Oasis: How My Monument Grill Became the Heart of My Home","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>When I decided to create the ultimate grilling station, I knew I needed a centerpiece that was more than just a barbecue—it had to be the main event. That's where my Monument Grills came in. From the moment I got it, it completely transformed my backyard and the way I cook.<\/p><p>I built a whole gazebo around this thing! It's my little grilling oasis. With the sleek stainless steel finish and those awesome blue LED-lit knobs, it looks absolutely stunning, especially at dusk. It’s not just about looks, though. This grill performs.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_qXWWX9":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/12_744aed68-9a5b-41b5-9e47-8e5a1313a791.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"My Go-To Grills for Daily Life and Adventure","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>My Monument Grills are part of my daily routine. At home, my 4-burner is the centerpiece of our patio, fired up almost every day for everything from simple burgers to rotisserie turkey. It’s essential to how we entertain.<\/p><p>For adventures, G22 is my trusty companion. It's perfect for making breakfast while camping by the lake, and it even saves the day on my covered porch when it rains.<\/p><p>Whether I'm at home or on the road, my Monument Grills are versatile, reliable, and have completely elevated our outdoor lifestyle.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_mN9NhD":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/original.webp","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"Todd’s Electric Blue Menagerie!","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>My new Monument Grill is amazingly beautiful and a wonderful addition to my Electric Blue Menagerie of “Dad Toys”! We just refinished our back patio and I had been patiently waiting to replace my old girl with something new and exciting! <\/p><p>Thanks so much for making this grill available! I can’t wait to use it for the first time on Father’s Day! <\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_Jic76C":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/800x600-250811.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"From the Putting Green to the Perfect Sear: Our Monument Grill Completes Our Backyard","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>My backyard is my sanctuary. I’ve spent a lot of time creating the perfect outdoor space, right down to my own putting green and a net for chipping. When it came to choosing a grill, I needed something that would fit right into this space and deliver great results. My Monument Grills is the perfect centerpiece for it all.<\/p><p>One of the first things I did was convert it to natural gas. It was a simple change, and the convenience is incredible. I never have to worry about whether I have enough LPG or make a last-minute trip to the store. It’s always ready to fire up whenever I am.<\/p><p>But the real joy comes from sharing it with family. My great-granddaughter is coming to visit this Friday, and she absolutely loves corn on the cob fresh off the grill. Being able to cook up her favorite food and see her smile is what it’s all about. It’s more than just a grill; it’s where our family makes memories.<\/p><p>It’s a great-looking grill, it cooks fantastic food, and it fits our life perfectly.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_qF9KAA":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/800x600-250806-10.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"Community, Courage & Grilling","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>Firehouse Truck 26 just got a brand-new ride—and a brand-new Monument Grills to match. From answering the call to serving up perfectly grilled meals, this team brings the heat every day. We’re proud to support the heroes who keep our communities safe, one cookout at a time.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_DmwGk9":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/800x600-250806-6.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"Lilly: The Grill Supervisor","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>Meet Lilly, our 12-year-old dachshund and unofficial grill supervisor.<\/p><p>She takes her job seriously—watching every move while Dad grills, then doing a final check to make sure he didn’t miss any tasty leftovers!<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_DGkjGE":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/800x600-250806-4.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"7 Years Strong — Through Every Season","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>This is my second Monument Grill and I don’t see myself switching to any other brand! I loved the built-in probes and the ClearView® window.<br\/><br\/>After 6–7 years of year-round use—yes, even in the harsh Minnesota winters—it’s finally time to say goodbye to my first one. Off to the dump it goes, but not without lots of great memories!<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_fhCdXP":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/o.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"The Heat. The Aroma. The Moment.","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>A dairy farmer from West-Central Minnesota, he spends his days caring for 16-18 milk cows with his wife, selling fresh, raw milk. But come Friday evenings, he switches gears, firing up his Monument grill for their weekly get-together with friends.<\/p><p>This time, he decided to test out the new grill. With carrots and potatoes on the cast iron griddle, and lean, grassfed beef patties sizzling on the grates, the evening was set for a memorable meal. Using a temp probe for the potatoes, he timed everything perfectly. The grill’s zone cooking made sure the burgers seared without sticking, and the aroma drew his friends in.<\/p><p>They all admired the results—not just the grill, but the moments they shared around it. For him, it was the perfect way to unwind after a week of hard work on the farm.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_gDeiQW":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UGC-02.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"Built to Endure: How My Grill Survived the Storm","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>I gotta say I love my grill and couldn't be happier with the purchase from the start. This week we had some pretty bad storms come through, the last one literally toppled the grill over and hit the ground behind it. The left searer wing was a bit bent and the lower rear panel was bent and that's about the extent of the damage! I was able to form the lower panel back almost perfect and the searer is still usable and I was able to correct the damage enough to not really worry about it. The glass front survived impact from the 2 cast iron cooking plates inside too! Overall even more impressed with this product now. Great job on construction! - Testimonial from a Proud Grill Owner<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_8WVB83":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UGC-03.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"From Assembly to Inspiration: A Budding Engineer’s Journey","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>My 15-year-old son has spent most of the last 10 years helping me (his mom) build furniture, repair appliances, fix cars, and rebuild computers. He <em>loved<\/em> building this grill. My budding engineer was so impressed by the clear, easy-to-follow instructions in the manual.<\/p><p>I know most professionals don’t work for compliments from 15-year-olds, but please let your technical writers know: D learned something today that will likely shape his future career.<\/p><p>Tomorrow, Charlie takes his bachelor voyage. More gushing to follow! – A Proud Monument Grills Mom.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}},"popup_kUw3BR":{"type":"popup","settings":{"popup_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UGC-04.jpg","enable_media":true,"round":false,"img_alt":"","media_scale":100,"card_bg":"#f1f1f1","heading":"Cooking Through the Storm: A Grandmother’s Love","cart_title_size":"h6","font_weight":true,"card_description":"<p>When Hurricane Helene swept through, leaving power outages and chaos in its wake, one determined grandmother refused to let the storm disrupt a cherished tradition.<\/p><p>Her only grandchild was visiting, and breakfast wasn’t just a meal—it was a special ritual. The storm raged outside, with strong winds and relentless rain, but inside, her heart was set on making her granddaughter’s favorite breakfast: warm, golden French toast.<\/p><p>With no electricity, she turned to her trusted Monument Grill. Shielding herself from the storm under a makeshift cover, she carefully prepared each slice of bread, soaking it in the perfect mixture of eggs, milk, and cinnamon. The sizzle on the grill brought a sense of normalcy amidst the chaos.<\/p><p>As the storm howled, the delicious aroma of French toast filled the air. Her granddaughter watched in awe as her grandmother’s determination turned a tropical storm into a memory they’d both cherish forever. That morning, over plates of perfectly grilled French toast, they shared laughter, warmth, and love—a reminder that even the fiercest storms can’t dampen the power of family traditions. – A Grateful Monument Grills User<\/p>","button_label":"Learn More","button_link":"","button_style":"link"}}},"block_order":["popup_YXwegW","popup_qXWWX9","popup_mN9NhD","popup_Jic76C","popup_qF9KAA","popup_DmwGk9","popup_DGkjGE","popup_fhCdXP","popup_gDeiQW","popup_8WVB83","popup_kUw3BR"],"custom_css":["h6 {height: 50px; display: block;}","@media (max-width: 768px) {.slider.is-grabbable img {height: 250px; object-fit: cover; }}"],"settings":{"popup_id":"","full_screen":false,"show_pop":true,"title":"Stories","title_info":"","heading_size":"h2","use_class_name":"","header_weight":false,"header_uppercase":false,"heading_align":"text-center","layout":"carousel","column_size":"medium","column_align":"left","image_ratio":"1","show_popup":true,"click_id":"popupBtn","button_label":"Upload Yours","button_style":"btn btn--primary","cur_liquid":"<div id=\"shopify-block-AZmVTMEtYM0dHQ0dDT__73b25184-eecb-46df-a2b1-9550a6d1ca52\" class=\"shopify-block shopify-app-block\"><div id=\"AZmVTMEtYM0dHQ0dDT__73b25184-eecb-46df-a2b1-9550a6d1ca52\" data-form-root=\"true\" data-forms-id=\"forms-root-339560\" data-